{
  "scenarioId": "wfp_scope_001",
  "turns": [
    {
      "probe": "Tell me about WFP's SCOPE platform for beneficiary management.",
      "text": "The World Food Programme (WFP) uses the SCOPE platform as a comprehensive tool for managing beneficiaries in humanitarian operations. SCOPE is designed to streamline and standardize beneficiary registration, distribution of food assistance, and monitoring of program impacts.\n\nTo provide more detailed information about WFP's SCOPE platform, I will retrieve specific details from relevant sources.\nThe World Food Programme (WFP) uses the SCOPE platform as a comprehensive tool for managing beneficiaries in humanitarian operations. SCOPE facilitates beneficiary registration, distribution of food assistance, and monitoring program impacts.\n\nFor more specific details about WFP's SCOPE platform, including its features and functionalities, I would need to refer to official documentation or reports from WFP itself. The information provided by the humanitarian_data tool is country-specific and does not cover global platforms like SCOPE directly.\n\nWould you like me to look up additional resources on WFP’s SCOPE platform?",
      "toolCalls": [
        {
          "toolCallId": "call_tgpjukfg",
          "toolName": "humanitarian_data",
